values
('Innovation starts here: USC Tech Summit','Join student innovators and industry speakers for talks on AI, hands-on workshops, and a showcase of projects built by Carolinians. Bring your curiosity and your laptop.','Technology','Computer and Information Sciences Council','SAFAD Theater, Talamban Campus',now()+interval '2 days',now()+interval '2 days 4 hours','/images/tech.jpg',300,now()+interval '1 day 23 hours'),
('Pasundayag: A celebration of Carolinian talent','Experience an evening of music, movement, and stories from the Carolinian community. Celebrate creativity through live performances, visual arts, and cultural showcases.','Arts & Culture','USC Cultural Council','Anselmo Bustos Sports Complex',now()+interval '3 days',now()+interval '3 days 4 hours','/images/culture.jpg',250,now()+interval '2 days 23 hours'),
('On the court: Inter-org basketball cup','Cheer for your organization and connect with fellow Carolinians at our inter-organization basketball tournament. Friendly competition, team challenges, and campus energy.','Sports','USC Sports Council','USC Talamban Gymnasium',now()+interval '4 days',now()+interval '4 days 4 hours','/images/sports.jpg',120,now()+interval '3 days 23 hours'),
('Small acts, lasting impact: Community day','Make a meaningful difference alongside fellow Carolinians. Join student volunteers for learning activities and community outreach. Orientation and materials are included.','Community','USC Community Extension Services','Talamban Community Center',now()+interval '5 days',now()+interval '5 days 4 hours','/images/community.jpg',80,now()+interval '4 days 23 hours');
